31251::$$$message_0237_0000_0000$$$::Nothing out of the ordinary here.[lr]::
31252::$$$message_0237_0000_0001$$$::It's dark compared to the Shinto city center in the distance, but I can hear signs of human activity if I listen carefully.::
31253::$$$message_0237_0001_0000$$$::An engine rumbles as a car passes by.[lr]::
31254::$$$message_0237_0001_0001$$$::[font color=0xEF0326]A jogger pants, their breath ragged.[rf][lr]::
31255::$$$message_0237_0001_0002$$$::Laughter rings from an illuminated home.[lr]::
31256::$$$message_0237_0001_0003$$$::[font color=0xEF0326]A jogger pants, their tongue sticking out of their mouth.[rf]::
31257::$$$message_0237_0002_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
31258::$$$message_0237_0002_0001$$$::Now, then.[lr]::
31259::$$$message_0237_0002_0002$$$::Maybe I should be getting home.::
931252::$$$message_9237_0000_0001$$$::It's dark compared to the Shinto city center in the distance, but I can hear signs of human activity if I listen carefully.::

